<?xml version="1.0"?>
<body language="English">
	<row id="msg_0607_T26PC0101_00000" index="0">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Homies get friendlier if you spend time\nwith ’em. Like people. Except my\fcousin.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0607_T26PC0101_00001" index="1">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">They light up the night like a\nbeacon...\rThey carry us across water when we\nain’t got a boat...\rHomies help us EVERYWHERE.\fI can’t imagine life without ’em!\fI’d have to get a JOB.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0607_T26PC0101_00002" index="2">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">There’s a dude in Cianwood City across\nthe sea braggin’ about rare homies.\rClout chaser. He post every homie he\ncatch.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0607_T26PC0101_00003" index="3">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">...THERE! All done!\fThis gon’ shock EVERYBODY!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0607_T26PC0101_00004" index="4">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Oh, you a Hustler?\rPerfect timin’! I just finished\ndecoratin’ my Hood Ball. Rhinestones.\rWanna scrap and be AMAZED by my\ndecorations? {YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0607_T26PC0101_00005" index="5">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">AIGHT! Here I come! Look at the\nSPARKLE!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0607_T26PC0101_00006" index="6">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Turn your Hood Balls into your own\ncreations with Seals!\rA Hood Ball NOBODY else got?\nThat’s drip, baby.\rOh, and put the Ball Capsule on a\nHood Ball once it’s ready!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0607_T26PC0101_00007" index="7">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Oh, for real? Holla at me if you wanna\nsee my Ball Capsule. It’s art.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0607_T26PC0101_00008" index="8">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Now you wanna see my Ball Capsule?\rScrap me so I can show you! {YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
</body>
